WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:17.364
Zann and his friends tried blasting through Morb's Shield spell, but it was too powerful.

2
00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.504
Perda peered through the translucent green wall.

3
00:00:20.524 --> 00:00:24.806
"Morb seems to be adjusting something on the contraption," she said.

4
00:00:24.826 --> 00:00:28.447
"We have to stop him before he puts the Mask on it."

5
00:00:29.327 --> 00:00:29.707
"I know."

6
00:00:30.347 --> 00:00:31.547
Zann paced around the hut.

7
00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:33.448
"But how do we do that?"

8
00:00:34.268 --> 00:00:35.309
Darb looked at Zann.

9
00:00:35.329 --> 00:00:38.031
"Wyssa said you're descended from King Zanta.

10
00:00:38.491 --> 00:00:42.694
Since the Mask got its power from him, maybe you have some sort of connection to it."

11
00:00:43.735 --> 00:00:44.395
Perda gasped.

12
00:00:44.415 --> 00:00:47.277
"That would be just like Wyssa's ring!"

13
00:00:47.857 --> 00:00:48.598
Darb nodded.

14
00:00:48.618 --> 00:00:52.080
"Wyssa said her ring had been in her family for generations.

15
00:00:52.581 --> 00:00:54.382
She used it to make her spells stronger.

16
00:00:55.042 --> 00:00:56.824
Maybe you could control the Mask, Zann."

17
00:00:58.084 --> 00:01:00.886
Zann didn't like being related to such a terrible tyrant.

18
00:01:01.607 --> 00:01:02.868
But what if his friends were right?

19
00:01:03.456 --> 00:01:04.317
He had to try.

20
00:01:05.378 --> 00:01:06.959
Zann stepped closer to the shield.

21
00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.722
Morb was now carrying the Mask to the contraption.

22
00:01:11.422 --> 00:01:14.425
Zann rubbed his hands together and focused on the Mask.

23
00:01:15.245 --> 00:01:17.987
"Come to me," he murmured.

24
00:01:18.748 --> 00:01:20.369
The relic jumped in Morb's hand!

25
00:01:20.389 --> 00:01:22.030
"What's going on?"

26
00:01:22.491 --> 00:01:23.171
Morb grumbled.

27
00:01:23.972 --> 00:01:26.414
Zann focused all of his energy on the Mask.

28
00:01:27.294 --> 00:01:28.976
"Come to me."

29
00:01:29.792 --> 00:01:34.294
This time the relic wiggled free of Morb's grip and flew halfway back toward the hut!

30
00:01:34.315 --> 00:01:37.716
"Stop!" Morb roared.

31
00:01:38.457 --> 00:01:40.118
He sent a blast of magic after it.

32
00:01:40.938 --> 00:01:44.160
The Mask hung in midair for a second and then flew back to him.

33
00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:46.301
Morb glared at Zann.

34
00:01:46.321 --> 00:01:48.122
"Give up, boy!

35
00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:50.943
My powers are much greater than yours."

36
00:01:51.604 --> 00:01:54.705
With a snap of his fingers, Morb shackled himself to the Mask.

37
00:01:55.646 --> 00:01:57.667
Zann concentrated hard on the Mask.

38
00:01:58.727 --> 00:02:00.248
"Wow!" Perda cried.

39
00:02:01.148 --> 00:02:03.909
Morb's entire body slid backward toward the hut.

40
00:02:03.929 --> 00:02:07.150
"How are you—oh, never mind!"

41
00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.151
He rubbed his fingers together.

42
00:02:09.471 --> 00:02:10.371
Sparks flew.

43
00:02:11.191 --> 00:02:15.072
Zann groaned as he felt Morb's magic fight back against his own.

44
00:02:15.092 --> 00:02:21.354
"I can't drag him anymore," Zann grunted.

45
00:02:22.014 --> 00:02:23.994
"His magic is too strong!"

46
00:02:24.715 --> 00:02:26.315
A moan rose nearby.

47
00:02:27.555 --> 00:02:29.536
The pile of insects shifted slightly.

48
00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.021
"Wyssa's still alive!"

49
00:02:32.341 --> 00:02:33.121
Perda exclaimed.

50
00:02:34.021 --> 00:02:37.823
She tried to shove some of the blank bugs away, but more kept swarming in.

51
00:02:38.843 --> 00:02:41.084
Zing woke up from the Immobilization spell.

52
00:02:41.905 --> 00:02:44.346
He flew over, shooting flames at the blank bugs.

53
00:02:44.926 --> 00:02:47.567
But they hardly seemed to notice their own bodies smoking.

54
00:02:47.587 --> 00:02:49.067
"Stop, Zing!

55
00:02:49.328 --> 00:02:50.168
You'll burn Wyssa."

56
00:02:51.028 --> 00:02:53.689
Darb glanced thoughtfully from the dragon to the blank bugs.

57
00:02:53.709 --> 00:02:55.990
"But I have an idea.

58
00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:59.251
Morb said these insects are related to dragons, right?

59
00:02:59.972 --> 00:03:03.842
Perda, can you try one of your fancy new spells to summon Teplo's sniffer goose?"

60
00:03:03.862 --> 00:03:06.123
"Sure," Perda said.

61
00:03:06.143 --> 00:03:10.625
"Why?" "That goose is a natural enemy of dragons," Darb said.

62
00:03:10.645 --> 00:03:13.906
"Maybe she'll recognize these bugs as dragons too!"

63
00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:15.787
"Do it quickly!"

64
00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:16.747
Zann cried.

65
00:03:17.488 --> 00:03:19.789
A magic blast hit him, knocking him down.

66
00:03:20.829 --> 00:03:24.251
He sat up and saw Morb bent over, breathing heavily.

67
00:03:24.271 --> 00:03:26.992
"I've tired him out," Zann thought.

68
00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:30.582
Perda rubbed her hands together and murmured under her breath.

69
00:03:31.903 --> 00:03:35.124
Suddenly the sniffer goose burst in through an opening in the hut.

70
00:03:35.945 --> 00:03:38.867
When she saw the bugs, she honked and flapped toward them.

71
00:03:39.687 --> 00:03:42.549
The blank bugs clicked with alarm and scurried out of the hut.

72
00:03:43.469 --> 00:03:45.971
Slowly Wyssa sat up, moaning.

73
00:03:45.991 --> 00:03:49.633
"Morb is walking toward the contraption again!"

74
00:03:49.933 --> 00:03:50.534
Gliss cried.

75
00:03:51.934 --> 00:03:53.976
That seemed to bring Wyssa back to her senses.

76
00:03:54.816 --> 00:03:57.998
She staggered to her feet and sent out a blast of magic energy.

77
00:03:58.778 --> 00:04:01.460
The green wall blocking the hut’s entrance vanished.

78
00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:05.402
"We have to stop Morb," she croaked.

79
00:04:06.302 --> 00:04:09.124
Zann was already at the hut’s entrance, racing toward Morb.

80
00:04:09.144 --> 00:04:11.305
"Get back, boy!"

81
00:04:11.665 --> 00:04:12.466
Morb snarled.

82
00:04:12.486 --> 00:04:18.889
"You can't—" Zann leaped forward and shackled himself to the Mask and Morb.

83
00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:23.852
When he touched the relic, a jolt ran through his body, almost knocking him over.

84
00:04:24.544 --> 00:04:30.486
He braced himself, remembering how another relic had taken over his mind and almost driven him crazy.

85
00:04:31.646 --> 00:04:33.026
But that didn't happen this time.

86
00:04:33.867 --> 00:04:37.227
Zann was flooded with a power that felt perfectly natural.

87
00:04:38.168 --> 00:04:39.468
He glanced toward his friends.

88
00:04:40.308 --> 00:04:42.189
The trolls were blocking them from helping him.

89
00:04:42.209 --> 00:04:44.529
"Zap!" he cried.

90
00:04:45.049 --> 00:04:49.291
He was hoping to zap himself, the Mask, and Morb away from the contraption.

91
00:04:50.071 --> 00:04:52.772
He felt a tug, but he was unable to zap away.

92
00:04:53.672 --> 00:04:54.372
Morb smirked.

93
00:04:55.032 --> 00:04:56.033
"Give up, Zann.

94
00:04:56.473 --> 00:04:59.475
You can't beat me—not this time."

95
00:05:00.336 --> 00:05:06.080
Gritting his teeth, Zann tried to drag Morb away from the contraption with both his muscles and his

96
00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:12.225
magic. Despite the extra energy surging into him from the Mask, he was tiring fast.

97
00:05:13.225 --> 00:05:14.526
Morb was too powerful!

98
00:05:15.687 --> 00:05:16.528
Morb sneered.

99
00:05:16.548 --> 00:05:18.689
"See what I mean?

100
00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:22.092
But perhaps my triumph can wait a few moments.

101
00:05:22.672 --> 00:05:26.875
It will be a pleasure to watch all the energy drain out of you first.

102
00:05:27.376 --> 00:05:30.498
Soon all of Magica will know how that feels!"

103
00:05:30.998 --> 00:05:33.280
He cackled with delight.

104
00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.822
Darb finally managed to dodge around the trolls.

105
00:05:37.823 --> 00:05:38.804
He edged closer.

106
00:05:40.345 --> 00:05:42.146
Morb spotted him and smiled.

107
00:05:42.166 --> 00:05:45.548
"Ah, the little Void," he said.

108
00:05:45.568 --> 00:05:47.370
"I like you, boy.

109
00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:50.452
You don't babble incessantly like your friends.

110
00:05:50.956 --> 00:05:53.537
Why don't you come with me when I leave Magica?

111
00:05:54.137 --> 00:05:55.658
I could use a servant."

112
00:05:56.118 --> 00:05:56.538
He winked.

113
00:05:56.558 --> 00:06:02.181
"If you prove loyal enough, perhaps I'll even teach you a few of the tricks Wyssa taught me."

114
00:06:02.201 --> 00:06:04.722
"Really?" Darb said.

115
00:06:05.742 --> 00:06:06.883
Zann's jaw dropped.

116
00:06:07.363 --> 00:06:10.024
Could Darb actually be considering Morb's offer?

117
00:06:10.044 --> 00:06:12.105
"Darb, no!"

118
00:06:12.565 --> 00:06:13.165
Gliss cried.

119
00:06:14.145 --> 00:06:15.186
Morb chuckled.

120
00:06:15.706 --> 00:06:18.847
"Ignore them, boy," he said, reaching out toward Darb.

121
00:06:18.867 --> 00:06:20.208
"Join me.

122
00:06:20.692 --> 00:06:22.073
You won't regret it."

123
00:06:23.154 --> 00:06:25.075
"No, I won't," Darb said.

124
00:06:26.055 --> 00:06:26.996
He stepped closer.

125
00:06:27.016 --> 00:06:29.917
"But you might regret some things soon!"

126
00:06:30.938 --> 00:06:35.601
He yanked something out of his pocket and tossed it to Zann, who caught it automatically with his

127
00:06:35.661 --> 00:06:36.221
free hand.

128
00:06:37.142 --> 00:06:40.744
Only then did he see what it was: the infusinator!

129
00:06:41.644 --> 00:06:44.066
Suddenly more energy flowed into Zann.

130
00:06:44.686 --> 00:06:46.047
This could be his chance!

131
00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.994
"Zap!" he shouted with every bit of energy he could muster.
